
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>F7TEEN | Collect Your Dream Machine</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#090909;color:#fff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:22px 7%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #333}
.logo{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:5px;font-weight:bold}
.logo span,h1 span{color:#e21b2d}
nav a{color:#fff;text-decoration:none;margin:8px;font-size:12px}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:100px 15px;background:radial-gradient(circle,#451018,#090909 70%)}
.tag{color:#ff4655;letter-spacing:4px;font-size:12px}
h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,85px);line-height:1.05}
.hero p,.muted{color:#aaa;line-height:1.8}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#e21b2d;color:white;padding:15px 25px;text-decoration:none;margin-top:20px}
section{padding:65px 7%}
h2{font-size:34px}
.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:20px}
.card{background:#151515;border:1px solid #333;padding:15px}
.car{height:160px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#333,#111);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:55px}
.card p{color:#aaa;font-size:13px}
.card a{color:#ff4655;text-decoration:none}
.story{background:#141414}
.contact{text-align:center;background:#350b12}
footer{text-align:center;padding:25px;color:#888;font-size:12px}
@media(max-width:550px){header{padding:18px 4%}nav a{margin:4px;font-size:10px}section{padding:45px 5%}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<div class="logo">F7<span>TEEN</span></div>
<nav>
<a href="#home">HOME</a>
<a href="#collection">SHOP</a>
<a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
<a href="#contact">CONTACT</a>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
<div class="tag">PREMIUM DIECAST COLLECTIBLES</div>
<h1>COLLECT YOUR<br><span>DREAM MACHINE.</span></h1>
<p>Miniature legends. Automotive passion.<br>Welcome to the world of F7TEEN.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#collection">EXPLORE COLLECTION</a>
</div>

<section id="collection">
<div class="tag">THE COLLECTION</div>
<h2>Find Your Dream Machine.</h2>
<p class="muted">Discover miniature automotive icons.</p>
<div class="products">
<div class="card">
<div class="car">🏎️</div>
<h3>Lamborghini</h3>
<p>Italian supercar legends.</p>
<a href="#contact">ENQUIRE ↗</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="car">🚘</div>
<h3>BMW</h3>
<p>Performance and precision.</p>
<a href="#contact">ENQUIRE ↗</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="car">🏎️</div>
<h3>Ferrari</h3>
<p>Racing heritage in miniature.</p>
<a href="#contact">ENQUIRE ↗</a>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="car">🚗</div>
<h3>Porsche</h3>
<p>Timeless automotive design.</p>
<a href="#contact">ENQUIRE ↗</a>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="story" id="about">
<div class="tag">OUR IDENTITY</div>
<h2>Welcome to F7TEEN.</h2>
<p class="muted">F7TEEN is built for people who appreciate iconic cars and the art of diecast collecting. From legendary supercars to performance machines, we celebrate automotive passion in miniature.</p>
<h3>SMALL MODELS. BIG DREAMS.</h3>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
<h2>LET'S TALK CARS.</h2>
<p>Find your next dream machine.</p>
<a class="btn" href="https://www.instagram.com/f7teen.co/" target="_blank">FOLLOW @F7TEEN.CO</a>
</section>

<footer>
F7TEEN © 2026 | COLLECT YOUR DREAM MACHINE.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
